00:21:41.450 --> 00:21:44.500
<i>This is the Magic for your "Switch"</i>

00:21:52.330 --> 00:21:57.950
<i>When you're hanging your head down</i> despondent, my girl, sorry for noticing

00:21:57.950 --> 00:22:00.830
<i>Don't smile vaguely</i>

00:22:00.830 --> 00:22:02.200
<i>Come here</i>

00:22:02.200 --> 00:22:03.750
<i>Come by my side</i>

00:22:03.750 --> 00:22:06.580
<i>With a soft, shy look</i>

00:22:06.580 --> 00:22:07.830
<i>Because humming</i>

00:22:07.830 --> 00:22:09.000
<i>The harmony</i>

00:22:09.000 --> 00:22:13.330
<i>Will make our body temperature go up a little</i>

00:22:13.330 --> 00:22:14.830
<i>(Sing the song)</i>

00:22:14.830 --> 00:22:17.080
<i>I want to help you</i>

00:22:17.080 --> 00:22:20.250
<i>I want to be your strength</i>

00:22:20.250 --> 00:22:23.040
<i>Words by themselves sound fake, huh?</i>

00:22:23.040 --> 00:22:25.950
<i>How about some magic like this, then?</i>

00:22:25.950 --> 00:22:28.790
<i>Watch carefully without looking away</i>

00:22:28.790 --> 00:22:31.700
<i>I'll push the "Switch" to change the world</i>

00:22:31.700 --> 00:22:35.620
<i>The sky looks the same as always</i>

00:22:35.620 --> 00:22:37.410
<i>I wonder about that</i>

00:22:37.410 --> 00:22:41.870
<i>It should already look different to your eyes</i> (Just for you)

00:22:41.870 --> 00:22:43.370
<i>It should be different</i>

00:22:43.370 --> 00:22:45.750
<i>That's right, Magic for your "Switch"</i>

00:22:45.750 --> 00:22:48.870
<i>Even if you're Cinderella</i>

00:22:48.870 --> 00:22:50.950
<i>Don't worry</i>

00:22:50.950 --> 00:22:51.910
<i>It'll be fine</i>

00:22:51.910 --> 00:22:57.250
<i>Our magic spell won't be broken</i>

00:22:57.250 --> 00:23:00.120
<i>It continues, and that's why it's Happy Magic</i>

00:23:00.120 --> 00:23:02.950
<i>It won't go away</i>

00:23:02.950 --> 00:23:08.910
<i>It'll protect your smile forever</i>

